      "role": "user",
      "content": "therapists just tell you things will get better but it never does. it just feels like i'm a constant weight. like, if i wasn't even here, they wouldn't have to worry about me constantly failing or making things harder for them. wouldn't it be more peaceful for them if they just didn't have to deal with me at all?",
